							"name": "Example: a step at T1:Quast_with_metadata",
							"documentation": "Original box text:\nExample in amber: a step at T1:Quast_with_metadata changes its T1, its T2 and the plots miaou and assembly_quality_dotplot. QC_Reads_Anchor and MLST_with_metadata are not touched, although metadata_schema is a source of all three. Rule of places (D-0553): at most one place on a path; a second place below the first on the same path is refused in one plain line; the first places of several original tables may be written together"
						},
