							"documentation": "Original box text:\nTwo plots sharing one table: a step at the table (T1 or T2 place) changes both, a step at T3 only the plot it is written at. A step has exactly one place; the same decision at several places is several nodes with one id, and removing by that id removes them all"
						},
						{
							"_type": "FCProcess",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGhy9GV9F86RYg=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGhysAab03u+aQ="
							},
							"name": "Colours: dark blue, light blue, grey, amber",
							"documentation": "Original box text:\nColours: dark blue = recomputed where the step is written (starting point); light blue = recomputed because it depends on it; grey = unchanged; amber = the user step"
						},
						{
