							"name": "NOT BUILT as drawn: audit_copy built instead",
							"documentation": "Original box text:\nNOT BUILT as drawn. Built instead: audit_copy (libs/utils/src/utils/audit_copy.py) writes a step as a plain step of a tier of a copy of the recipe; audit_places and audit_view (app/modules) choose the places and read the audit copy; audit_run runs the copy"
						},
